ers: median 18 ms, but P90 274 ms.\n\nThe OpenTSLM comparison has several real concerns:\n\n\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1192 Inhaltsliste\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1193 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1194 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1195 text The reported checkpoint is explicitly a  canary , apparently limited to 8,192 examples and three epochs—not a comparable full-budget run. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1196 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1197 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1198 text It learns indirectly: signal → soft-prompt tokens → language model → generated JSON. Token loss also covers formatting and evidence prose rather than focusing only on classification. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1199 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1200 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1201 text Checkpoint selection uses language-model validation loss, not macro-F1 or parse validity. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1202 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1203 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1204 text 22.1% of outputs failed strict parsing. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1205 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1206 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1207 text Evaluation uses summary prompts, while the canary training mixed summary and atomic prompts. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1208 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1209 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1210 text The warm-start path does not explicitly apply the YAML LoRA rank/alpha/dropout settings; it relies on OpenTSLM defaults ([train_opentslm.py](/Users/Student/Downloads/EHL_Zurich/ysamet/model_training/src/robot_observability/train_opentslm.py:56)). ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1211 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1212 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1213 text The comparison branch lacks the OpenTSLM manifest, learning curve, raw predictions, and checkpoint. Its quoted metrics also contain fields not produced by the evaluator committed on this branch, so the result is not fully reproducible. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1214 container ece , Conclusion: the CNN run looks valid; OpenTSLM has not yet received a fair, fully traceable training run. I would not conclude that CNN fundamentally beats OpenTSLM until OpenTSLM is retrained at full budget, selected using downstream validation metrics, and evaluated with the same strict typed scorer and record IDs. , 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1215 Text 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1216 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1217 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1218 text Conclusion:  the CNN run looks valid; OpenTSLM has not yet received a fair, fully traceable training run.  I would not conclude that CNN fundamentally beats OpenTSLM until OpenTSLM is retrained at full budget, selected using downstream validation metrics, and evaluated with the same strict typed scorer and record IDs.\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1219 container ece , o zaman training komple bittiğinde bakarız , 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1220 Text 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1221 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1222 Text o zaman training komple bittiğinde bakarız\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1223 container ata , training komple bittiğinde de accuracyde geçemeyeceğiz büyük iht , 01:55\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1224 Kopfzeile ata 01:55, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1225 Button ata\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1226 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1227 Text 01:55\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1228 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 01:55\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1229 Text training komple bittiğinde de accuracyde geçemeyeceğiz büyük iht\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\