och 23. Its weak point is onset outliers: median 18 ms, but P90 274 ms.\n\nThe OpenTSLM comparison has several real concerns:\n\n\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1191 Inhaltsliste\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1192 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1193 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1194 text The reported checkpoint is explicitly a  canary , apparently limited to 8,192 examples and three epochs—not a comparable full-budget run. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1195 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1196 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1197 text It learns indirectly: signal → soft-prompt tokens → language model → generated JSON. Token loss also covers formatting and evidence prose rather than focusing only on classification. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1198 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1199 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1200 text Checkpoint selection uses language-model validation loss, not macro-F1 or parse validity. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1201 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1202 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1203 text 22.1% of outputs failed strict parsing. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1204 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1205 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1206 text Evaluation uses summary prompts, while the canary training mixed summary and atomic prompts. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1207 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1208 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1209 text The warm-start path does not explicitly apply the YAML LoRA rank/alpha/dropout settings; it relies on OpenTSLM defaults ([train_opentslm.py](/Users/Student/Downloads/EHL_Zurich/ysamet/model_training/src/robot_observability/train_opentslm.py:56)). ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1210 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1211 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1212 text The comparison branch lacks the OpenTSLM manifest, learning curve, raw predictions, and checkpoint. Its quoted metrics also contain fields not produced by the evaluator committed on this branch, so the result is not fully reproducible. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1213 container ece , Conclusion: the CNN run looks valid; OpenTSLM has not yet received a fair, fully traceable training run. I would not conclude that CNN fundamentally beats OpenTSLM until OpenTSLM is retrained at full budget, selected using downstream validation metrics, and evaluated with the same strict typed scorer and record IDs. , 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1214 Text 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1215 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1216 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1217 text Conclusion:  the CNN run looks valid; OpenTSLM has not yet received a fair, fully traceable training run.  I would not conclude that CNN fundamentally beats OpenTSLM until OpenTSLM is retrained at full budget, selected using downstream validation metrics, and evaluated with the same strict typed scorer and record IDs.\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1218 container ece , o zaman training komple bittiğinde bakarız , 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1219 Text 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1220 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1221 Text o zaman training komple bittiğinde bakarız\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1222 container ata , training komple bittiğinde de accuracyde geçemeyeceğiz büyük iht , 01:55\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1223 Kopfzeile ata 01:55, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1224 Button ata\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1225 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1226 Text 01:55\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1227 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 01:55\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1228 Text training komple bittiğinde de accuracyde geçemeyeceğiz büyük iht\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1229 container ata , o kulvarda yarı