ernal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260070.373397,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"output":"","type":"function_call_output"},{"arguments":"{\"target\":\"/root/judge_audit\",\"message\":\"REDACTED\"}","call_id":"call_vCuvBksjvPJzanudZwEI6HWL","id":"fc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f12b404487d2b702e6d075198635","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260070.85274,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"name":"followup_task","namespace":"collaboration","type":"function_call"},{"call_id":"call_vCuvBksjvPJzanudZwEI6HWL","id":"fco_01a09836-1564-7e10-8ae3-61fade37d202","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260076.388363,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"output":"","type":"function_call_output"},{"arguments":"{\"target\":\"/root/product_critic\",\"message\":\"REDACTED\"}","call_id":"call_wkl1NA8buoi4h0yVd8sjCSKk","id":"fc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f13e318887d28f721820b94bb6e9","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260092.817902,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"name":"followup_task","namespace":"collaboration","type":"function_call"},{"call_id":"call_wkl1NA8buoi4h0yVd8sjCSKk","id":"fco_01a09836-605a-7a21-9200-998a02af5d17","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260095.578819,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"output":"","type":"function_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f141b88c87d28f803815ba8faee0","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"call_id":"call_q40iBvd7NrwJ2g2m58wPE90u","id":"ctc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f14205e887d2a9af022ee7e48923","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet/docs/submission/VERIFICATION.md\\n@@\\n-# Verification, 12 September 2026\\n+# Verification, 13 September 2026\\n \\n-Base: main `126a8c6`. Entire enabled for the worktree; Codex hooks installed and approval records present. Only intended product, test and submission files are included.\\n+Base: main `db68e6c`; final hardening is on `codex/final-submission-hardening`. Entire is enabled for the worktree; Codex hooks are installed and approval records are present.\\n@@\\n-| Independent comparison rerun | JSON and Markdown byte-identical with fixed bootstrap seed |\\n-| New comparison regressions | 15 passed: invalid/missing answers, boolean/null/nonnumeric onset, mismatched targets, IDs and test sessions |\\n-| Training focused suite | 25 passed; `test_checkpoints.py` excluded because optional PyTorch is absent in the clean local environment |\\n-| Data ingestion, `pytest data_ingestion/tests -q` | 50 passed, including TimeNet tests and missing-clock regression |\\n-| Inference, `python3 -m unittest discover -s inference -p 'test_*.py' -v` | 22 passed, with localhost server permission |\\n-| Frontend, `npm test` | 37 passed, including investigation provenance, half-open marker boundaries, reduced-resolution labeling and frozen replay horizon |\\n-| Combined tree with dataset-scout PR #3 | Clean merge simulation; 54 frontend tests passed and production build passed |\\n+| Independent comparison rerun | JSON byte-identical with fixed bootstrap seed; 512 windows / 67 recordings |\\n+| Training focused suite | 26 passed across comparison, metrics and signal-feature baseline tests |\\n+| Data ingestion | 60 passed in the component virtual environment, including TimeNet coverage |\\n+| Inference, `python3 -m unittest discover -s inference -p 'test_*.py' -v` | 28 passed with temporary localhost server permission |\\n+| Frontend, `npm test` | 81 passed, including structured prediction isolation, model/measurement disagreement, investigation provenance and replay contracts |\\n | Frontend, `npm run build` | Passed; existing optional 3D chunk remains over Vite's 500 kB advisory threshold |\\n@@\\n-| Browser, 1280×720 desktop and 390×844 mobile | Real automatic model answer, evidence control and export visible; mobile document width 390 px with no horizontal overflow |\\n+| Browser, desktop | Structured prediction, J4/J2 review note, predicted 3D moment, seven-channel evidence, reference comparison and Markdown export verified through the live UI |\\n@@\\n-## Integration boundary\\n-\\n-PR #3 was the only open PR and GitHub reported it mergeable against main. Its scout, service contracts and data workspace are preserved as separate work. The combined frontend was freshly tested (54 tests and production build); the scout backend was not rerun. Training-branch artifacts are scored from their original saved predictions; training processes and model deployment were not modified. The training branch already conflicts with main in `train_opentslm.py`; this was reproduced against unmodified main. The comparison README section was placed to avoid introducing an additional conflict. The active training branch was not merged or rewritten.\\n+## Integration boundary\\n+\\n+PR #19 is the only open pull request. It joins approved dataset sourcing to one-shot ingestion and remains outside the frozen two-minute demo until its broad service and UI changes receive a dedicated review. Training artifacts are scored from their saved predictions; training processes and model deployment were not modified. CNN results remain evaluation-only because no CNN checkpoint or inference endpoint is connected.\\n@@\\n-- Checkpoint delivery to the challenge is still an external submission step, and the live backbone revision is unknown.\\n+- Checkpoint delivery to the challenge is still an external submission step. The backbone file identity is resolved by hash in `CHECKPOINT_HANDOFF.md`, but the live receipt still reports an unknown backbone revision.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260096.266612,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_q40iBvd7NrwJ2g2m58wPE90u","id":"ctco_01a09836-8a5c-7fe2-8681-7505e4b31d9c","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260106.332087,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f14ba6f087d29bf9ce5260ee4007","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"call_id":"call_3tMe9KAbGvh2kR53BxupeZBH","id":"ctc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f14e0fc887d293fab4b0edc0b42c","input":"const results = await Promise.allSettled([\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:5174/api/health\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":4000}),\n  tools.exec_command({cmd:\"curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:5174/api/models\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":6000})\n]);\nfor (const r of results) {\n  if (r.status === \"fulfilled\") text(r.value.output);\n  else text(`ERROR: ${r.reason}`);\n}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260106.557157,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_3tMe9KAbGvh2kR53BxupeZBH","id":"ctco_01a09836-9e6c-7ed3-bf8f-79a822cda0e6","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260111.468818,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"curl: (7) Failed to connect to 127.0.0.1 port 5174 after 0 ms: Couldn't connect to server\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"curl: (7) Failed to connect to 127.0.0.1 port 5174 after 0 ms: Couldn't connect to server\n","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f152e0f087d28add9b8b96ab7884","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"call_id":"call_X5NPPKba6n8mIBS4rUhP98Kb","id":"ctc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f1532af887d2a3c6a387f82e4825","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:5174/api/health \u0026\u0026 curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:5174/api/models\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":8000,\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"May I verify the live local frontend proxy and private inference tunnel health outside the sandbox?\",\"prefix_rule\":[\"curl\",\"-fsS\",\"http://127.0.0.1:5174\"]});\ntext(r.output); if (r.session_id) text(`SESSION_ID=${r.session_id}`);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260111.714309,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_X5NPPKba6n8mIBS4rUhP98Kb","id":"ctco_01a09836-bc4f-74a0-a616-80082e3d2574","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260119.119546,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.6 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"ready\": true, \"modelId\": \"team-opentslm\", \"revision\": \"checkpoint-sha256:8ff63b84ae5b64758f66b3e0527f4f225a04bb2b6b39193c806f58d94cec9f23; config:4dbdd82f5ff7; backbone:unknown\", \"status\": \"ready\"}[{\"id\": \"assistant\", \"label\": \"Telemetry assistant\", \"available\": true, \"capabilities\": [\"language\"], \"revision\": \"checkpoint-sha256:8ff63b84ae5b64758f66b3e0527f4f225a04bb2b6b39193c806f58d94cec9f23; config:4dbdd82f5ff7; backbone:unknown\"}, {\"id\": \"opentslm\", \"label\": \"OpenTSLM\", \"available\": true, \"capabilities\": [\"language\"], \"revision\": \"checkpoint-sha256:8ff63b84ae5b64758f66b3e0527f4f225a04bb2b6b39193c806f58d94cec9f23; config:4dbdd82f5ff7; backbone:unknown\"}]","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f15884a087d28e6a03a657864091","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"call_id":"call_8ymYMMBCKZ2jXOkL7lXNWTEZ","id":"ctc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f158a42087d2a1dcbffdcac8da54","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 -m inference.smoke --base-url http://127.0.0.1:5174/api --case accidental --output /tmp/trace-hardening-smoke.json\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet\",\"yield_time_ms\":30000,\"max_output_tokens\":12000,\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"May I run one real canary-v4 inference through the frontend proxy to verify the complete demo path?\",\"prefix_rule\":[\"python3\",\"-m\",\"inference.smoke\"]});\ntext(r.output); if (r.session_id) text(`SESSION_ID=${r.session_id}`);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260119.304811,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_8ymYMMBCKZ2jXOkL7lXNWTEZ","id":"ctco_01a09837-3429-7871-8662-e0d32e4c4c62","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260149.801399,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 27.9 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"Measured in this selected window\nLargest observed torque ranges: Joint 2 (7.296 Nm range), Joint 4 (3.334 Nm range), Joint 1 (1.256 Nm range).\n\nOpenTSLM interpretation\nOpenTSLM predicts external contact. Interaction class: accidental. Strongest predicted disturbance: J4. Affected joints: J4, J2. Predicted onset: 312 ms after the window starts. Predicted evidence interval: 312–562 ms. Treat these generated predictions as leads, not verified physical facts.\n\nSaved traceable result to /tmp/trace-hardening-smoke.json\n","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"author":"/root/judge_audit","content":[{"text":"Message Type: MESSAGE\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/judge_audit\nPayload:\n","type":"input_text"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","type":"encrypted_content"}],"id":"amsg_01a09837-342a-7c32-96e0-ead607e42419","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260149.802798,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"recipient":"/root","type":"agent_message"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f177945887d28b0d6fafd87941c6","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[{"text":"**Evaluating critical fixes**\n\nI've identified a need to address UI language regarding \"disagreement.\" The current review note isn't clear, so I think renaming it to \"difference\"","type":"summary_text"}],"type":"reasoning"},{"author":"/root/product_critic","content":[{"text":"Message Type: MESSAGE\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/product_critic\nPayload:\n","type":"input_text"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","type":"encrypted_content"}],"id":"amsg_01a09837-4bec-70b2-afb0-6d7baa6ff90a","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260155.884947,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"recipient":"/root","type":"agent_message"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f1817f8487d2af43f1d8167a7284","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"author":"/root/product_critic","content":[{"text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/product_critic\nPayload:\nReview sent.\n\nVerdict: the revised flow is useful and appropriately focused. I recommended only:\n\n1. Label the model/measurement difference as a **cross-check between different quantities**.\n2. Mark reference comparison **optional** and call the 3D action a **generated onset cue**.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"amsg_01a09837-64cc-76e1-844f-ea1072d37632","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260162.252291,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"recipient":"/root","type":"agent_message"},{"author":"/root/judge_audit","content":[{"text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/judge_audit\nPayload:\nAudit delivered.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"amsg_01a09837-64cd-7f53-a78a-3eec3c8cb4bc","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260162.253505,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"recipient":"/root","type":"agent_message"},{"call_id":"call_ir7w1JEf6mREHYwNO35FSHvU","id":"ctc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f1867f9087d29b2894c0b2f48026","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet/frontend/src/assistant/predictionReview.ts\\n@@\\n-/** Surface a model/measurement disagreement without treating either quantity as physical truth. */\\n+/** Surface a cross-check between different model and measurement quantities. */\\n@@\\n-    note: `OpenTSLM highlights ${prediction.strongest_joint}, while ${largestRangeJoint} has the largest measured torque range. Review both signals before sharing this handoff.`,\\n+    note: `OpenTSLM predicts ${prediction.strongest_joint} as the strongest disturbance. ${largestRangeJoint} has the largest measured torque range. These are different quantities; inspect both before handoff.`,\\n*** Update File: /Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet/frontend/src/assistant/predictionReview.test.ts\\n@@\\n-  it('flags a visible model and measurement disagreement', () =\u003e {\\n+  it('surfaces a cross-check between model and measurement rankings', () =\u003e {\\n@@\\n-      note: 'OpenTSLM highlights J4, while J2 has the largest measured torque range. Review both signals before sharing this handoff.',\\n+      note: 'OpenTSLM predicts J4 as the strongest disturbance. J2 has the largest measured torque range. These are different quantities; inspect both before handoff.',\\n*** Update File: /Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet/frontend/src/assistant/AssistantPanel.tsx\\n@@\\n-      {!messages.length \u0026\u0026 \u003cdiv className=\\\"conversation-intro\\\"\u003e\u003cWaves size={26}/\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePrepare a reviewable incident handoff.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eRun one selected window, verify the prediction against its exact signals, then export the evidence for a controls engineer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp className=\\\"intro-limit\\\"\u003eRecorded torque can guide investigation. It cannot verify a physical cause.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e}\\n+      {!messages.length \u0026\u0026 \u003cdiv className=\\\"conversation-intro\\\"\u003e\u003cWaves size={26}/\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePrepare a reviewable incident handoff.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnalyze the incident, verify the prediction against exact signals, then export the handoff for a controls engineer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp className=\\\"intro-limit\\\"\u003eRecorded torque can guide investigation. It cannot verify a physical cause.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e}\\n@@\\n-              {brief ? \u003c\u003e\u003csection className=\\\"prediction-summary\\\"\u003e\u003ch3\u003e{brief.title}\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cdiv className=\\\"prediction-facts\\\"\u003e{brief.strongest \u0026\u0026 \u003cspan\u003ePredicted strongest joint \u003cstrong\u003e{brief.strongest}\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e}{brief.onset !== undefined \u0026\u0026 \u003cspan\u003ePredicted onset \u003cstrong\u003e{brief.onset} ms\u003c/strong\u003e into the window\u003c/span\u003e}\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp className=\\\"prediction-caution\\\"\u003eOpenTSLM prediction · not a verified physical diagnosis.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e{measuredText \u0026\u0026 \u003csection className=\\\"measured-summary\\\"\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMeasured torque\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e{measuredText}\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e}{review \u0026\u0026 \u003csection className=\\\"review-note\\\"\u003e\u003ch3\u003eReview note\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e{review.note}\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e}\u003c/\u003e : m.text ? \u003cAnswerText text={m.text}/\u003e : null}\\n+              {brief ? \u003c\u003e\u003csection className=\\\"prediction-summary\\\"\u003e\u003ch3\u003e{brief.title}\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cdiv className=\\\"prediction-facts\\\"\u003e{brief.strongest \u0026\u0026 \u003cspan\u003ePredicted strongest joint \u003cstrong\u003e{brief.strongest}\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e}{brief.onset !== undefined \u0026\u0026 \u003cspan\u003ePredicted onset \u003cstrong\u003e{brief.onset} ms\u003c/strong\u003e into the window\u003c/span\u003e}\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp className=\\\"prediction-caution\\\"\u003eOpenTSLM prediction · not a verified physical diagnosis.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e{measuredText \u0026\u0026 \u003csection className=\\\"measured-summary\\\"\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMeasured torque\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e{measuredText}\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e}{review \u0026\u0026 \u003csection className=\\\"review-note\\\"\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCross-check\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e{review.note}\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e}\u003c/\u003e : m.text ? \u003cAnswerText text={m.text}/\u003e : null}\\n@@\\n-              {cue \u0026\u0026 \u003cli\u003e\u003cbutton onClick={() =\u003e onRobotPrediction(cue)}\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShow predicted moment in 3D\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cArrowUpRight size={12}/\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/li\u003e}\\n+              {cue \u0026\u0026 \u003cli\u003e\u003cbutton onClick={() =\u003e onRobotPrediction(cue)}\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShow generated onset cue in 3D\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cArrowUpRight size={12}/\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/li\u003e}\\n@@\\n-              \u003cli\u003e\u003cbutton onClick={() =\u003e onCompare(m.interval)}\u003e\u003cspan\u003e{cue ? 3 : m.evidence.length ? 2 : 1}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompare with a reference window\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cArrowUpRight size={12}/\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n+              \u003cli\u003e\u003cbutton onClick={() =\u003e onCompare(m.interval)}\u003e\u003cspan\u003e{cue ? 3 : m.evidence.length ? 2 : 1}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompare with a reference window · optional\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cArrowUpRight size={12}/\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\\n*** Update File: /Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet/frontend/src/assistant/investigationReport.ts\\n@@\\n-    '## Review before handoff',\\n+    '## Cross-check before handoff',\\n*** Update File: /Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet/frontend/src/assistant/investigationReport.test.ts\\n@@\\n-    expect(markdown).toContain('## Review before handoff');\\n+    expect(markdown).toContain('## Cross-check before handoff');\\n*** Update File: /Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet/docs/submission/DEMO.md\\n@@\\n-| 0:00–0:15 | Start on the selected publisher event and click **Analyze interval** | “The robot stopped at 6.187 seconds. A controls engineer receives a timestamp and seven synchronized traces, then has to prepare a handoff for the controls lead or vendor.” |\\n+| 0:00–0:15 | Start on the selected publisher event and click **Analyze interval** | “An incident was annotated at 6.187 seconds. A controls engineer receives that timestamp and seven synchronized traces, then has to prepare a handoff for the controls lead or vendor.” |\\n@@\\n-| 0:55–1:15 | Point to **Review note**, then click **Inspect exact seven-channel input** | “The model highlights J4, while J2 has the largest measured torque range. Trace exposes that disagreement and links back to the exact signals instead of hiding it in prose.” |\\n+| 0:55–1:15 | Point to **Cross-check**, then click **Inspect exact seven-channel input** | “The model predicts J4 as strongest, while J2 has the largest raw torque range. Those are different rankings. Trace links both back to the exact signals instead of hiding the distinction in prose.” |\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260164.692266,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_ir7w1JEf6mREHYwNO35FSHvU","id":"ctco_01a09837-a5bd-7842-a7fb-7cd14fa8fdcd","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260178.8777,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.5 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f19601b087d282a2e4064be7238a","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f1961ff487d28dc7b894c850c6c2","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"arguments":"{\"code\":\"await braveApp.click(29); await braveApp.getAXState({disableDiffing:true});\",\"title\":\"Check the team group chat\"}","call_id":"call_dV1t6dv9JdQ1BTqiSOlM2Rfi","id":"fc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa5f1988c4c87d2a1fee2ff689f9b61","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789260179.302136,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"name":"js","namespace":"mcp__cua_repl","type":"function_call"},{"call_id":"call_dV1t6dv9JdQ1BTqiSOlM2Rfi","id":"fco_01a09837-c39a-7bd1-a288-b3232