 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 01:54\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t499 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t500 Text I found no obvious CNN training bug. Validation macro-F1 was 0.990 and test was 0.975, with a normal learning curve and sensible early stopping at epoch 23. Its weak point is onset outliers: median 18 ms, but P90 274 ms.\n\nThe OpenTSLM comparison has several real concerns:\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t501 Inhaltsliste\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t502 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t503 AXListMarker • \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t504 text The reported checkpoint is explicitly a  canary , apparently limited to 8,192 examples and three epochs—not a comparable full-budget run. ,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t505 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t506 AXListMarker • \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t507 text It learns indirectly: signal → soft-prompt tokens → language model → generated JSON. Token loss also covers formatting and evidence prose rather than focusing only on classification. ,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t508 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t509 AXListMarker • \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t510 text Checkpoint selection uses language-model validation loss, not macro-F1 or parse validity. ,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t511 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t512 AXListMarker • \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t513 text 22.1% of outputs failed strict parsing. ,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t514 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t515 AXListMarker • \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t516 text Evaluation uses summary prompts, while the canary training mixed summary and atomic prompts. ,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t517 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t518 AXListMarker • \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t519 text The warm-start path does not explicitly apply the YAML LoRA rank/alpha/dropout settings; it relies on OpenTSLM defaults ([train_opentslm.py](/Users/Student/Downloads/EHL_Zurich/ysamet/model_training/src/robot_observability/train_opentslm.py:56)). ,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t520 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t521 AXListMarker • \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t522 text The comparison branch lacks the OpenTSLM manifest, learning curve, raw predictions, and checkpoint. Its quoted metrics also contain fields not produced by the evaluator committed on this branch, so the result is not fully reproducible. ,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t523 container ece , Conclusion: the CNN run looks valid; OpenTSLM has not yet received a fair, fully traceable training run. I would not conclude that CNN fundamentally beats OpenTSLM until OpenTSLM is retrained at full budget, selected using downstream validation metrics, and evaluated with the same strict typed scorer and record IDs. , 01:54\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t524 Text 01:54\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t525 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 01:54\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t526 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t527 text Conclusion:  the CNN run looks valid; OpenTSLM has not yet received a fair, fully traceable training run.  I would not conclude that CNN fundamentally beats OpenTSLM until OpenTSLM is retrained at full budget, selected using downstream validation metrics, and evaluated with the same strict typed scorer and record IDs.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t528 container ece , o zaman training komple bittiğinde bakarız , 01:54\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t529 Text 01:54\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t530 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 01:54\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t531 Text o zaman training komple bittiğinde bakarız\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t532 container ata , training komple bittiğinde de accuracyde geçemeyeceğiz büyük iht , 01:55\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t533 Kopfzeile ata 01:55, Value: 3\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t534 Button ata\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t535 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t536 Text 01:55\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t537 Text Sonnt