\t\t\t\t\t1022 Text Reaktion hinzufügen\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1023 container ece , I found no obvious CNN training bug. Validation macro-F1 was 0.990 and test was 0.975, with a normal learning curve and sensible early stopping at epoch 23. Its weak point is onset outliers: median 18 ms, but P90 274 ms. The OpenTSLM comparison has several real concerns: The reported checkpoint is explicitly a canary, apparently limited to 8,192 examples and three epochs—not a comparable full-budget run. , It learns indirectly: signal → soft-prompt tokens → language model → generated JSON. Token loss \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1024 Text 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1025 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1026 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1027 Text I found no obvious CNN training bug. Validation macro-F1 was 0.990 and test was 0.975, with a normal learning curve and sensible early stopping at epoch 23. Its weak point is onset outliers: median 18 ms, but P90 274 ms.\n\nThe OpenTSLM comparison has several real concerns:\n\n\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1028 Inhaltsliste\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1029 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1030 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1031 text The reported checkpoint is explicitly a  canary , apparently limited to 8,192 examples and three epochs—not a comparable full-budget run. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1032 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1033 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1034 text It learns indirectly: signal → soft-prompt tokens → language model → generated JSON. Token loss also covers formatting and evidence prose rather than focusing only on classification. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1035 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1036 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1037 text Checkpoint selection uses language-model validation loss, not macro-F1 or parse validity. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1038 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1039 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1040 text 22.1% of outputs failed strict parsing. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1041 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1042 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1043 text Evaluation uses summary prompts, while the canary training mixed summary and atomic prompts. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1044 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1045 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1046 text The warm-start path does not explicitly apply the YAML LoRA rank/alpha/dropout settings; it relies on OpenTSLM defaults ([train_opentslm.py](/Users/Student/Downloads/EHL_Zurich/ysamet/model_training/src/robot_observability/train_opentslm.py:56)). ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1047 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1048 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1049 text The comparison branch lacks the OpenTSLM manifest, learning curve, raw predictions, and checkpoint. Its quoted metrics also contain fields not produced by the evaluator committed on this branch, so the result is not fully reproducible. ,\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1050 container ece , Conclusion: the CNN run looks valid; OpenTSLM has not yet received a fair, fully traceable training run. I would not conclude that CNN fundamentally beats OpenTSLM until OpenTSLM is retrained at full budget, selected using downstream validation metrics, and evaluated with the same strict typed scorer and record IDs. , 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1051 Text 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1052 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 01:54\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1053 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1054 text Conclusion:  the CNN run looks valid; OpenTSLM has not yet received a fair, fully traceable training run.  I would not conclude that CNN fundamentally beats OpenTSLM until Ope