t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1190 Text 02:26\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1191 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 02:26\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1192 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1193 Text Ben birazdan uycam, codex benim yerime devam caliscak, 6'da kalkarim, o da bizim discord chat'i okucak sorunuz varsa yada feature request felan. Senin söyledigin feature fazla sürmez sanirim \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1194 Button 🙂\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1195 Bild ohne Label 🙂\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1196 container sd38 , Kontrol ettim: backend sadece OpenTSLM serve ediyor; CNN checkpoint/endpoint yok. Fake selector eklemiyorum. Endpoint gelirse model seçimini ekleyebilirim. , 02:44\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1197 Kopfzeile sd38 02:44, Value: 3\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1198 Button sd38\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1199 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1200 Text 02:44\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1201 Text Sonntag, 13. September 2026 um 02:44\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1202 Text Kontrol ettim: backend sadece OpenTSLM serve ediyor; CNN checkpoint/endpoint yok. Fake selector eklemiyorum. Endpoint gelirse model seçimini ekleyebilirim.\n~\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t672 Bereich für Texteinträge (settable) Nachricht an Zurich Hackathon, Value: ﻿\n\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1203 Text ﻿\nThe focused UI element is 672 Bereich für Texteinträge (settable) Nachricht an Zurich Hackathon, Value: ﻿\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d","create_time":1789260267.371266}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":30000}}
